    <item>
      <title>上诉法院维持对特朗普宴会厅建设的阻止</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/07/us/politics/trump-ballroom-appeals-court.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[联邦上诉法院小组支持下级法院的裁决，并使得最高法院有可能对此案做出裁决。但这一决定并不意味着施工将立即停止。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/07/us/politics/trump-ballroom-appeals-court.html</guid>
